WEBVTT

00:15:28.375 --> 00:15:30.143
meditate twice a day,

00:15:30.167 --> 00:15:31.976
and yet,

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.393
I walk around in fear,

00:15:34.417 --> 00:15:38.851
because I know that someone
seeing me as a threat

00:15:38.875 --> 00:15:41.351
can become a threat to my life,

00:15:41.375 --> 00:15:43.042
and I am tired.

00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:45.434
I am tired of carrying

00:15:45.458 --> 00:15:49.309
this invisible burden
of other people's fears,

00:15:49.333 --> 00:15:51.393
and many of us are,

00:15:51.417 --> 00:15:53.601
and we shouldn't have to,

00:15:53.625 --> 00:15:56.518
because we can change this,

00:15:56.542 --> 00:16:01.059
because we can change the action,
which changes the story,